Greenplum-MapReduce version 0.01
================================

INSTALLATION

To install this module type the following:

   perl Makefile.PL
   make
   make test
   make install

DEPENDENCIES

This module requires these other modules and libraries:

  YAML::Tiny     - simple YAML parser
  Params::Smart  - smart function parameter arguments
  Regexp::Common - needed by Params::Smart
  Test::More     - needed for testing only


